# Summer Robotics Challenge

## LinkedIn closers

End every Summer Robotics Challenge LinkedIn post with this line (swap week number):

```
Week X of the summer robotics hosted by Robotics Nation. Blog in comments ♟️
```

- Use "Blog in comments" (not "Writeup in comments" or "Full writeup in comments").
- One emoji at the end (♟️ for chess-heavy weeks; 🤖 acceptable for hardware-heavy weeks if it fits).
- Blog link goes in the first comment, not the post body.

## Reference

- Week 2 posted opener: "We don't play chess anymore."
- Week 1 closer pattern was informal; from week 2 onward use the Robotics Nation line above.
